  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧科技與管理應用",
    "sub_ename": "INTELLIGENCE TECHNOLOGY AND MANAGERIAL APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "課程提供商業管理應用智慧科技概念，啟發學生科技管理或者協助傳統業者利用物聯網、大數據、人工智慧、生物辨識、區塊鏈等技術以及社群網絡及行動載具應用，強化利用本身既有通路，提供數位化進行商業服務與管理。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to help students learn concepts of the managerial application of intelligence technology. Students will learn to leverage the techniques of Internet of Things (IoT), big data, artificial intelligence, biometrics, and block-chain in technology management to assist practitioners in business transformation. Students will also learn the application of social network as well as Apps to enhance their capabilities in emerging channel management, digital business service and management.",
